{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Reenchant Demo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>Reenchant</i> with this special demo version. Unlike the full game, the demo ramps up in difficulty every two nights, making survival a true challenge. In fact, it's designed to be unbeatable... so brace yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes a global leaderboard. Think you can beat the developers\u2019 high score? Give it a shot, or simply enjoy the game at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Reenchant?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Reenchant</i>, you take on the role of an ancient Tree Spirit, defending your home against relentless lumberjacks. As they tear down your forest, it's up to you to restore nature and preserve its beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/36184e4fa997b984e6b0c48378355b98.poster.avif?t=1757759976\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/36184e4fa997b984e6b0c48378355b98.webm?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/36184e4fa997b984e6b0c48378355b98.mp4?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regrow trees from scattered trunks to form natural towers. Each tree type gains strength when grouped, so strategic planting is key. Assign friendly forest spirits to your trees. They will distract, slow and frighten the lumberjacks until you're strong enough to drive them away for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/cf56baee0e1988e25c9c2178ded13b45.poster.avif?t=1757759976\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/cf56baee0e1988e25c9c2178ded13b45.webm?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/cf56baee0e1988e25c9c2178ded13b45.mp4?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/e2cc3dda70b55bc4f693f100c135430f.poster.avif?t=1757759976\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/e2cc3dda70b55bc4f693f100c135430f.webm?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/e2cc3dda70b55bc4f693f100c135430f.mp4?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Befriend Forest Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're not defending, explore the island and aid its inhabitants. In return, they\u2019ll gift you Mana and reveal hidden tips to deepen your understanding of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/a514099c42de1a2ca20f33d1ab64bdb1.poster.avif?t=1757759976\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/a514099c42de1a2ca20f33d1ab64bdb1.webm?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/a514099c42de1a2ca20f33d1ab64bdb1.mp4?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Mana to get a speed boost. Drop it on your path and retrieve it for a swift return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/02b7d16862d0025d24cbc06c2bd6ba9e.poster.avif?t=1757759976\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/02b7d16862d0025d24cbc06c2bd6ba9e.webm?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/02b7d16862d0025d24cbc06c2bd6ba9e.mp4?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Short Playtime, High Replay Value</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core game takes around 2\u20134 hours to complete. For those seeking more, higher difficulty levels and procedurally generated tree placements offer further challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Without Words</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reenchant</i> features no spoken or written words. Discover its secrets by observing and exploring your way through the forest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why I made Reenchant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reenchant</i> was born in the depths of winter, when my longing for green trees became too strong to ignore. I turned to <i>Kingdom</i>, a game I\u2019ve always loved for its mystical forests, but felt sad when, in the end, all the trees were chopped down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to reverse that feeling, to create a game where nature fights back and beauty triumphs over destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I find peace in my daily walks through the forest and hope some of that meditative joy has found its way into <i>Reenchant</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984990?t=1757759976","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984990?t=1757759976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/dd86e6566381288e15019cc8498af0e320996b12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757759976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/dd86e6566381288e15019cc8498af0e320996b12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757759976","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Reenchant Demo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>Reenchant</i> with this special demo version. Unlike the full game, the demo ramps up in difficulty every two nights, making survival a true challenge. In fact, it's designed to be unbeatable... so brace yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes a global leaderboard. Think you can beat the developers\u2019 high score? Give it a shot, or simply enjoy the game at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Reenchant?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Reenchant</i>, you take on the role of an ancient Tree Spirit, defending your home against relentless lumberjacks. As they tear down your forest, it's up to you to restore nature and preserve its beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/36184e4fa997b984e6b0c48378355b98.poster.avif?t=1757759976\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/36184e4fa997b984e6b0c48378355b98.webm?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/36184e4fa997b984e6b0c48378355b98.mp4?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Your Defenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regrow trees from scattered trunks to form natural towers. Each tree type gains strength when grouped, so strategic planting is key. Assign friendly forest spirits to your trees. They will distract, slow and frighten the lumberjacks until you're strong enough to drive them away for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/cf56baee0e1988e25c9c2178ded13b45.poster.avif?t=1757759976\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/cf56baee0e1988e25c9c2178ded13b45.webm?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/cf56baee0e1988e25c9c2178ded13b45.mp4?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/e2cc3dda70b55bc4f693f100c135430f.poster.avif?t=1757759976\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/e2cc3dda70b55bc4f693f100c135430f.webm?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/e2cc3dda70b55bc4f693f100c135430f.mp4?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Befriend Forest Creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're not defending, explore the island and aid its inhabitants. In return, they\u2019ll gift you Mana and reveal hidden tips to deepen your understanding of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/a514099c42de1a2ca20f33d1ab64bdb1.poster.avif?t=1757759976\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/a514099c42de1a2ca20f33d1ab64bdb1.webm?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/a514099c42de1a2ca20f33d1ab64bdb1.mp4?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Mana to get a speed boost. Drop it on your path and retrieve it for a swift return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/02b7d16862d0025d24cbc06c2bd6ba9e.poster.avif?t=1757759976\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/02b7d16862d0025d24cbc06c2bd6ba9e.webm?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/extras/02b7d16862d0025d24cbc06c2bd6ba9e.mp4?t=1757759976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Short Playtime, High Replay Value</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core game takes around 2\u20134 hours to complete. For those seeking more, higher difficulty levels and procedurally generated tree placements offer further challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Without Words</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reenchant</i> features no spoken or written words. Discover its secrets by observing and exploring your way through the forest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why I made Reenchant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reenchant</i> was born in the depths of winter, when my longing for green trees became too strong to ignore. I turned to <i>Kingdom</i>, a game I\u2019ve always loved for its mystical forests, but felt sad when, in the end, all the trees were chopped down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to reverse that feeling, to create a game where nature fights back and beauty triumphs over destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I find peace in my daily walks through the forest and hope some of that meditative joy has found its way into <i>Reenchant</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Surfin Bird"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3984730","name":"Reenchant"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984990/d57fc249215ee8ef8a5a4d60735e854969589c6f/header.jpg?t=1757759976","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257190567,"mp4":{"480":